{"id":"659861","name":"抹茶生巧雪糕","author":"宅家吃货JACKERLU","authorId":"12121547","desc":"","cover":"images/659861/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"白巧克力","amount":"100克"},{"name":"抹茶粉","amount":"10克"},{"name":"淡奶油","amount":"220克"}],"sub":[{"name":"白砂糖","amount":"20克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"白巧克力100克，先切成均匀的小块。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/09/20240709172048988557578012121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":2,"desc":"再隔热水融化均匀。注：水温不要太高，70℃左右就行。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/09/20240709172048988594995712121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":3,"desc":"筛入抹茶粉10克。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/09/20240709172048988614155312121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":4,"desc":"慢慢搅拌至抹茶粉完全融化，颜色均匀。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/09/20240709172048992858038712121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入淡奶油80克。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/09/20240709172048996658056912121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":6,"desc":"搅拌均匀，让液体温度降低备用。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/09/20240709172048994612321612121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":7,"desc":"淡奶油140克，白砂糖20克，打发至有纹路，微稠的状态。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/09/20240709172048995259517412121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入准备好的抹茶巧克力液。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/09/20240709172048998611488312121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":9,"desc":"稍微打发均匀一下即可。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/09/20240709172048999104794412121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":10,"desc":"然后挤入模具里。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/09/20240709172049000232425012121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":11,"desc":"冷冻6-8小时定型。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/09/20240709172049001247161512121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step"